        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:379.1236267089844,683.22607421875,1706.6930236816406,1939.738037109375",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<p><i>Registration mark on left</i></p>\n\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">[Let it be registered in the office of accounts,]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[if God wills.]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[They have registered the amount of two, a half, a third and an eighth.]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[Praise be to God for his bounties.]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">A valid receipt has been granted to the warehouse-keeper in the province of al-Fayy\u016bm on behalf of \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan ibn Wahb, the estate manager,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">for the year four-hundred and three, under the supervision of the auspicious, rightly-guided judge, \u1e6eiqat al-Mulk Mak\u012bn al-Dawla</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">wa-\u02beAm\u012bnuh\u0101, the prot\u00e9g\u00e9 of the commander of the faithful, \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan \u02bfAl\u012b ibn Bah\u0101r, with \u02beAb\u016b al-Sar\u012b</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Theodor ibn Yu\u1e25annis acting as accountant.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Half of this: One, a third and an eight. Its amount: Two, a half, a third and an eighth din\u0101rs.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Written by M\u012b\u1e35\u0101'\u012bl ibn \u02bfAbd al-Mas\u012b\u1e25, the cashier. Valid. The twenty-fifth of \u1e0e\u0169 al-\u1e24ijja</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">in the year four-hundred and three.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
